    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d243">

                <pb facs="0425" n="355" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg355"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Campbell</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 18.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-01-30"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 30, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have received your private note of the
                    23d instant, in which you state the reasons which make it necessary for you to
                    leave New Orleans for a short time, and ask permission to do so, which is
                    accordingly granted you, if you think it eminently necessary; which question is
                    left to your discretion.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lewis D. Campbell</hi>, Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c.,&amp;c.,&amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
